👑🧠 Birbal and the Greatest Fool (Raw Story)

One day, Emperor Akbar asked Birbal, “Who is the greatest fool in my kingdom?”

Birbal said, “I will show you tomorrow.”

The next day, Birbal brought a man to the court.

The man was carrying a bundle of clothes on his head while riding a donkey.

Akbar laughed and asked, “Why are you carrying the load on your head?”

The man replied, “I don’t want to trouble my donkey.”

Birbal smiled and said, “Even though he sits on the donkey, he still carries the load himself.”

Akbar understood the lesson.

💖 Moral:

Foolish thinking leads to unnecessary trouble.